---
import OfficialLayout from '../layouts/OfficialLayout.astro'
---

<OfficialLayout title="争议评审" description="珠江国际商事调解院 - 争议评审 Dispute Review Board">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image: url('/images/hero-bg.jpg');" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-950/85 via-violet-900/75 to-gray-900/85" />
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 text-xs text-white/80 mb-4">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m14.5 12.5-8-8a2.119 2.119 0 1 1 3-3l8 8"/><path d="m16 16 6-6"/><path d="m8 8 6-6"/><path d="m9 7 8 8"/><path d="m21 11-8-8"/></svg>
        <span>Dispute Review Board · DRB</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white">争议评审</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-violet-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Dispute Review Board</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <!-- What is Dispute Review -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">什么是争议评审</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
          <p>
            争议评审（Dispute Review Board，简称 DRB）是一种在建设工程、长期合同等项目中广泛应用的争议解决机制。
            由中立第三方专家组成评审团，对合同履行过程中出现的争议事项进行专业评审，出具具有约束力或建议性的评审意见。
          </p>
          <p>
            珠江国际商事调解院的争议评审服务，依托于本院与国内外知名仲裁机构的深度合作，
            整合建筑工程、国际贸易、金融投资等领域的资深专家资源，为当事人提供高效、经济的争议评审解决方案。
          </p>
          <p>
            与传统的诉讼、仲裁相比，争议评审具有<strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">程序灵活、周期短、成本低、专业性强</strong>等突出优势，
            是目前国际上越来越受到重视的替代性争议解决方式。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Features -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">核心优势</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">实时争议解决</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">争议发生时即时介入评审，避免问题累积和矛盾激化，保障项目顺利推进。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">专家评审团</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">由各方共同选定行业专家组成评审团，确保评审意见的专业性和权威性。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">成本可控</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">相比传统诉讼仲裁，程序简化、周期短、费用可预算，大幅降低纠纷解决总成本。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">保密可靠</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">严格保密评审程序与材料，保护商业秘密和商业信誉，维护合作关系。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Process -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">评审流程</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex gap-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 font-bold text-sm">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">组建评审团</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">合同签订时或争议发生前，由各方共同选定 1-3 名行业专家组成常设评审团，定期了解项目进展。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 font-bold text-sm">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">提交争议事项</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">任何一方均可就合同履行中出现的分歧提交书面材料，说明争议事项、相关事实及请求。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 font-bold text-sm">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">评审听证</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">评审团召开听证会，听取各方陈述、审查证据，并可进行现场勘查和专家咨询。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 font-bold text-sm">4</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">出具评审意见</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">评审团在约定时限内出具书面评审意见，阐明事实认定、合同解释及处理建议。当事人可选择接受或转为正式仲裁。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Applicable Scenarios -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">适用场景</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-800/30 rounded-xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-200">建设工程施工合同争议</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-800/30 rounded-xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-200">基础设施 PPP 项目争议</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-800/30 rounded-xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-200">长期供货合同履行争议</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-800/30 rounded-xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-200">技术开发与合作合同争议</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-800/30 rounded-xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-200">国际工程承包 EPC 项目争议</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-800/30 rounded-xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-200">合资企业治理与股东争议</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-violet-600 text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-violet-700 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          咨询争议评审服务
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</OfficialLayout>
